		You Die!

	There are alot of truths about death, and alot of garbage
that players like to spread about it. Here is exactly what happens
when you die.

	All of your skills, stats, level, experience, is reduced by
one point. If you are a in the death scene, or are a ghost, you can
be raised or ressurrected, and be brought back to life. This then
lessens the effect of death upon you. Ressurrection means you only
loose one off most of your stats, not all of them. I.e some stats
are not effected.

	When you die, and leave the death scene, you end up in the
Temple of the All-God. If you pray when there, Aleena the prophet,
raises you from the dead. Then, you can start playing all over again!

					Angel, 1994
